#: muga/settings_window.py:1239
msgid ""
"A client authenticates with a token, so the server only starts once there is "
"one. Add a token first."
msgstr ""
"Ein Client meldet sich mit einem Token an — der Server startet also erst, "
"wenn es eines gibt. Lege zuerst ein Token an."

#: muga/settings_window.py:1048
msgid ""
"A client has to present one of these as a bearer token. Give every client "
